          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.028,
          "end": 32.17,
          "en": "so it actually gets easier if I pick a higher difficulty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.17,
          "end": 36.074,
          "en": "Now the reason for that is that in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
